[Everything about automated script detection is configurable](https://github.com/jquery/jquery/blob/master/src/ajax/script.js#L8) so it's pretty easy to disable it (untested examples that should work):

``` js
// Good: disable javascript detection globally
$.ajaxSetup( {
    contents: {
        javascript: false
    }
} );

// Acceptable: disable text to javascript promotion (but will break intended manual conversions)
$.ajaxSetup( {
    converters: {
        "test => javascript": false
    }
} );

// Preferred: use a prefilter to be more specific (only crossDomain)
$.ajaxPrefilter( function( s ) {
    if ( s.crossDomain ) {
        s.contents.javascript = false;
    }
} );
```

